      "Your primary Business Profile category should be the single most accurate description of what you do, not the broadest one. A \"family dentist\" ranks better for dental searches under that specific category than under a generic \"Medical Clinic.\" Secondary categories help you show up for adjacent searches, but stuffing in categories that don't genuinely apply can hurt more than help.",
