      "Profiles with more photos consistently get more clicks and requests for directions than bare-bones ones. Add real photos of your storefront, interior, team, and work — not stock images — and add new ones periodically rather than uploading five photos once and never returning. Google and customers both read an actively-maintained profile as more trustworthy.",
