    title: "Video Marketing for Chennai Restaurants and Retail Shops: Reels, Shorts, and What Actually Drives Footfall",
    excerpt:
      "Every Chennai restaurant and retail shop is being told to \"do more video,\" but most posted reels get almost no reach. Here's what actually drives footfall versus what just adds to the noise.",
    date: "August 20, 2026",
    author: {
      name: "Priyanka D.",
      role: "Founder, My DP Digital",
      avatar:
        "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534528741775-53994a69daeb?w=120&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80",
    },
