      "The higher tiers add things that genuinely cost more to deliver: video content (reels, shorts) rather than static images, paid ad management layered on top of organic posting, and detailed monthly reporting tied to actual business outcomes rather than vanity metrics like follower count. This tier is worth it once a business has outgrown organic-only reach and needs paid amplification managed properly, not just more posts.",
