    title: "Website Design Proposal Checklist: What Should It Include?",
    excerpt: "A useful website proposal is more than a price. Use this checklist to compare scope, page structure, content responsibilities, ownership, launch checks and ongoing support before you sign.",
    date: "November 17, 2026",
    author: {"name":"Priyanka D.","role":"Founder, My DP Digital","avatar":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534528741775-53994a69daeb?w=120&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80"},
